# electron-builder output. `dist/` above only matches that exact name -
# repeated local builds used to be kept side by side as dist2/, dist3/ ...
# dist22/ (~16GB of dead build output that showed up as untracked noise in
# every `git status`). The exe is built and published by CI now (see the
# build-desktop job), so no local copy needs keeping at all.
